<div id="A4.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">For JailbreakV evaluation, we follow the default configuration and set the user message as follows.</p>
<div id="A4.SS3.p8.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
